 this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-mobius-centred-nonneg"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-mobius-centred-nonneg"],"id":"long.thm-mobius-centred-nonneg","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.11 (Möbius-centred carry nonnegativity below $`1/2`$)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.11, p. 48, label thm:mobius-centred-nonneg","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*If $1\\notin A$ and $X_A(2)<1/2$, then $C_A(N)\\ge0$ for every $N$. Indeed,\n$$\n\\operatorname{ihc}(A,N)=2^{N+1}(1/2-X_A(2))+\n \\sum_{j>N+1}c_A(j)2^{N+1-j}>0.\n$$\nThe carry is an integer, so it is at least $1$; subtracting $1$ gives the asserted nonnegativity of the centred carry. The strict inequality and integrality are both needed in this argument. The statement is about the divisor counts $c_A$, not a new irrationality criterion.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.thm-mobius-centred-nonneg","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.thm-mobius-centred-nonneg","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.thm-mobius-centred-nonneg%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.integerHalfCarry_eq_scaled_residual_add_tail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.thm-mobius-centred-nonneg%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.integerHalfCarry_eq_scaled_residual_add_tail%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.HalfCarryReachability.integerHalfCarry_eq_scaled_residual_add_tail"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a376671